<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>BOHEN Services Ltd</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

:root{
  --green:#88C86F;
  --green-dark:#5DA848;
  --blue:#2D5F8E;
  --orange:#F39A12;
  --dark:#0f172a;
  --light:#f8fafc;
}

*{
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
  box-sizing:border-box;
}

html{
  scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
  font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
  background:white;
  color:var(--dark);
  overflow-x:hidden;
}

header{
  position:fixed;
  width:100%;
  top:0;
  z-index:1000;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);
  backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);
}

.navbar{
  max-width:1200px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:18px 20px;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;
}

.logo{
  font-size:1.4rem;
  font-weight:800;
  color:var(--blue);
}

.logo span{
  color:var(--green-dark);
}

nav{
  display:flex;
  gap:25px;
}

nav a{
  text-decoration:none;
  color:var(--dark);
  font-weight:600;
}

nav a:hover{
  color:var(--green-dark);
}

.hero{
  min-height:100vh;

  background:
  radial-gradient(circle at top right,
  rgba(136,200,111,.3),
  transparent 40%),

  radial-gradient(circle at bottom left,
  rgba(45,95,142,.15),
  transparent 40%),

  white;

  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;

  text-align:center;

  padding:140px 20px 80px;
}

.hero-content{
  max-width:850px;
}

.badge{
  display:inline-block;
  background:#ecfdf5;
  color:var(--green-dark);
  padding:12px 20px;
  border-radius:40px;
  font-weight:700;
  margin-bottom:25px;
}

.hero h1{
  font-size:4.8rem;
  line-height:1;
  margin-bottom:25px;
}

.hero h1 span{
  color:var(--green-dark);
}

.hero p{
  font-size:1.2rem;
  color:#475569;
  max-width:700px;
  margin:auto;
  line-height:1.8;
}

.hero-buttons{
  margin-top:40px;
}

.btn{
  display:inline-block;
  padding:16px 30px;
  border-radius:12px;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:700;
  margin:8px;
}

.btn-primary{
  background:var(--orange);
  color:white;
}

.btn-secondary{
  background:var(--green);
  color:white;
}

.section{
  padding:100px 20px;
}

.container{
  max-width:1200px;
  margin:auto;
}

.section-title{
  text-align:center;
  font-size:3rem;
  margin-bottom:15px;
}

.section-subtitle{
  text-align:center;
  color:#64748b;
  margin-bottom:60px;
}

.services{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));
  gap:30px;
}

.card{
  background:white;
  border-radius:24px;
  padding:35px;
  box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.08);

  border-top:6px solid var(--green);
  transition:.3s;
}

.card:hover{
  transform:translateY(-8px);
}

.card-icon{
  font-size:3rem;
  margin-bottom:20px;
}

.card h3{
  margin-bottom:15px;
  color:var(--blue);
}

.card p{
  color:#64748b;
  line-height:1.8;
}

.green-section{
  background:linear-gradient(
  135deg,
  #ecfdf5,
  #ffffff
  );
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<div class="navbar">

<div class="logo">
BOHEN <span>Services</span>
</div>

<nav>
<a href="#services">Services</a>
<a href="#projects">Projects</a>
<a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

</div>
</header>

<section class="hero">

<div class="hero-content">

<div class="badge">
Trusted Across Poole, Bournemouth & Christchurch
</div>

<h1>
Keeping Homes
<span>Running Smoothly</span>
</h1>

<p>
Professional plumbing, heating and property maintenance services delivered with quality workmanship, honest advice and exceptional customer care.
</p>

<div class="hero-buttons">

<a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">
Get Free Quote
</a>

<a href="tel:07872301729" class="btn btn-secondary">
Emergency Call Out
</a>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section class="section" id="services">

<div class="container">

<h2 class="section-title">
Our Services
</h2>

<p class="section-subtitle">
Everything your home needs from one trusted local company.
</p>

<div class="services">

<div class="card">

<div class="card-icon">💧</div>

<h3>Plumbing</h3>

<p>
Repairs, leaks, installations and emergency plumbing solutions.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="card-icon">🔥</div>

<h3>Heating</h3>

<p>
Boiler servicing

<p>
Reliable maintenance solutions for homes and businesses.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
